translate spanish a1s4_10ac3bf0:

    # "Amicus squints at me, like he can't quite believe what I just said."
    "Amicus entrecierra los ojos como si no pudiera creer lo que acabo de decir."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1075
translate spanish a1s4_f41aecd7:

    # a "\"Are you...making fun of me?\""
    a "\"¿Te estás... burlando de mí?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1076
translate spanish a1s4_8f19b94e:

    # m "\"What? No! I'm telling you so you don't feel so bad about it. It's fine.\""
    m "\"¿Qué? ¡No! Te lo digo para que no te sientas tan mal. No pasa nada.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1077
translate spanish a1s4_69f0220c:

    # a "\"Oh.\""
    a "\"Ah.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1079
translate spanish a1s4_496b2569:

    # a "\"That's quite the coincidence.\""
    a "\"Es toda una coincidencia.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1080
translate spanish a1s4_bee80475:

    # m "\"Yeah, it is.\""
    m "\"Sí, lo es.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1081
translate spanish a1s4_8302c713:

    # a "\"Well, uh, thank you for telling me. That isn't easy to do, at least it isn't for me.\""
    a "\"Bueno, eh, gracias por decírmelo. No es fácil, al menos para mí.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1082
translate spanish a1s4_43d33f0d:

    # m "\"I'm the same.\""
    m "\"A mí me pasa igual.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1083
translate spanish a1s4_08028c69:

    # "I slowly walk over and sit on the sofa next to the wolf, feeling strangely awkward about our little coming out conversation."
    "Me acerco despacio y me siento en el sofá junto al lobo, sintiéndome extrañamente incómodo después de nuestra pequeña conversación para salir del armario."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1084
translate spanish a1s4_b0a6ad85:

    # "Amicus still looks a bit uncomfortable, but at least he doesn't look sad anymore."
    "Amicus todavía parece algo incómodo, pero al menos ya no está triste."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1085
translate spanish a1s4_0988c18a:

    # m "\"Soooo, since we're talking about all of this...what was Neferu saying about me...helping you out with your dick. Is that a pet duty too?\""
    m "\"Bueeeno, ya que hablamos de todo esto... ¿qué decía Neferu de que yo... te ayudara con la polla? ¿Eso también es una obligación de la mascota?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1087
translate spanish a1s4_c61f177f:

    # a "\"Well, yes, yes it is. But again, I would never ask that of you.\""
    a "\"Bueno, sí, lo es. Pero, de nuevo, nunca te lo pediría.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1088
translate spanish a1s4_db34a898:

    # m "\"Does Alex do that?\""
    m "\"¿Alex hace eso?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1090
translate spanish a1s4_c03a3102:

    # "Amicus pulls a face."
    "Amicus hace una mueca."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1091
translate spanish a1s4_89eda736:

    # a "\"While I'd rather not think of my brother in such a situation, yes, he does.\""
    a "\"Aunque preferiría no pensar en mi hermano en una situación así, sí, lo hace.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1092
translate spanish a1s4_5959d4d5:

    # m "\"But...does that mean your brother's gay too?\""
    m "\"Pero... ¿eso significa que tu hermano también es gay?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1094
translate spanish a1s4_e6dce92e:

    # a "\"No, well, not as far as I know. He doesn't have a preference for males. Isn't that what makes you a homosexual?\""
    a "\"No, bueno, que yo sepa no. No tiene preferencia por los varones. ¿No es eso lo que te hace homosexual?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1095
translate spanish a1s4_8619f2c6_1:

    # "I shrug."
    "Me encojo de hombros."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1096
translate spanish a1s4_118d18df:

    # m "\"So I'd just...give you a hand-job, or something?\""
    m "\"¿Entonces yo simplemente... te masturbaría con la mano o algo así?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1098
translate spanish a1s4_9c22525e:

    # "I can tell that the Lingua had no trouble translating that to Amicus, because he immediately blushes again."
    "Veo que la Lingua no tuvo problemas para traducírselo a Amicus, porque se ruboriza de inmediato otra vez."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1099
translate spanish a1s4_2940e9ae:

    # "I squirm, wondering why I'm asking so much about this topic."
    "Me remuevo, preguntándome por qué hago tantas preguntas sobre este tema."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1100
translate spanish a1s4_14fbb01c:

    # "I'm curious and I already know that I'm attracted to this wolf."
    "Tengo curiosidad y ya sé que este lobo me atrae."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1101
translate spanish a1s4_816546ad:

    # "I'd given up on denying it a while ago."
    "Hace tiempo que dejé de negarlo."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1102
translate spanish a1s4_91eafdcf:

    # a "\"It can involve a lot of things...I mean, if you want to do it, I have no objections...but it's your choice!\""
    a "\"Puede incluir muchas cosas... quiero decir, si quieres hacerlo, no tengo objeciones... ¡pero es decisión tuya!\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1103
translate spanish a1s4_ed75ff4d:

    # "Amicus sounds tentatively hopeful, and I realize that he actually wants it."
    "Amicus habla con una esperanza tímida y me doy cuenta de que realmente lo quiere."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1104
translate spanish a1s4_921026fb:

    # "It seems that every day I go further and further with this wolf."
    "Parece que cada día llego más lejos con este lobo."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1105
translate spanish a1s4_886741dc:

    # "I laugh, partly at Amicus's expression, and partly because of the absurdity of this entire situation."
    "Me río, en parte por la expresión de Amicus y en parte por lo absurdo de toda la situación."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1106
translate spanish a1s4_9e6bc8f3:

    # m "\"How about if we win the dance trial...I'll think about it.\""
    m "\"¿Qué te parece si, cuando ganemos la prueba de baile... me lo pienso?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1107
translate spanish a1s4_3c38ecb7:

    # "I'm speaking without thinking."
    "Hablo sin pensar."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1108
translate spanish a1s4_569bb2f5:

    # "Amicus is quiet, then nods."
    "Amicus guarda silencio y después asiente."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1110
translate spanish a1s4_ea044ba4:

    # a "\"Sounds fair.\""
    a "\"Me parece justo.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1111
translate spanish a1s4_dc7c6ef0:

    # "I try to think of something else to talk about, still shocked at what I'd just proposed."
    "Intento pensar en otra cosa de la que hablar, todavía sorprendido por lo que acabo de proponer."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1112
translate spanish a1s4_09816e00:

    # m "\"So what's the deal with Neferu? Why'd he do all that stuff in the bath?\""
    m "\"Entonces, ¿qué le pasa a Neferu? ¿Por qué hizo todo eso en el baño?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1114
translate spanish a1s4_717b1dbd:

    # a "\"I honestly have no idea. It was very strange.\""
    a "\"Sinceramente, no tengo ni idea. Fue muy extraño.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1115
translate spanish a1s4_f9c9adf4:

    # m "\"Hmm, do you think that's his way of furthering an alliance?\""
    m "\"Mmm, ¿crees que es su manera de promover una alianza?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1117
translate spanish a1s4_3f58a604:

    # a "\"Not if he has any common sense. I thought he was going to be friendly considering he knows I'm open to the alliance, unlike Cassius.\""
    a "\"No, si tiene algo de sentido común. Creía que sería amable, ya que sabe que estoy abierto a la alianza, a diferencia de Cassius.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1118
translate spanish a1s4_1bb0b2a0:

    # "I lean back on the sofa, thinking."
    "Me recuesto en el sofá, pensando."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1119
translate spanish a1s4_84bccb62:

    # m "\"Hmm, maybe he was just feeling you out.\""
    m "\"Mmm, quizá solo te estaba tanteando.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1120
translate spanish a1s4_9c5bdf06:

    # "Amicus smirks at that."
    "Amicus sonríe con malicia ante eso."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1122
translate spanish a1s4_c9bd43c6:

    # a "\"You could say that. Anyway, I don't know how to feel about him. I'm thinking of just telling him that I'm not interested in the alliance unless they send someone that has more tact.\""
    a "\"Se podría decir así. En fin, no sé qué pensar de él. Estoy considerando decirle que no me interesa la alianza a menos que envíen a alguien con más tacto.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1123
translate spanish a1s4_4ad4d594:

    # "Amicus glances at me."
    "Amicus me mira de reojo."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1124
translate spanish a1s4_615b956e:

    # a "\"What do you think?\""
    a "\"¿Qué te parece?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1130
translate spanish a1s4_2e90bbe1:

    # m "\"Well...I think if he's the only guy you have to establish the alliance with, you should try to work with him. I mean, this could be your best chance if you're willing to put up with him.\""
    m "\"Bueno... creo que, si es la única persona con la que puedes establecer la alianza, deberías intentar trabajar con él. Puede ser tu mejor oportunidad si estás dispuesto a soportarlo.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1132
translate spanish a1s4_fea09bf9_1:

    # a "\"Hmmm...\""
    a "\"Mmm...\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1133
translate spanish a1s4_562aceec:

    # m "\"And he seems to have the hots for you, so that'll probably help you, honestly.\""
    m "\"Y parece que le atraes, así que eso probablemente te ayude, sinceramente.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1135
translate spanish a1s4_0d98fafa:

    # a "\"Heh, maybe.\""
    a "\"Je, quizá.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1137
translate spanish a1s4_d1834f85:

    # m "\"Honestly, if that's what the Khemians send to foster an alliance, I have to wonder about them as a whole.\""
    m "\"Sinceramente, si eso es lo que envían los Khemianos para promover una alianza, tengo que cuestionarlos en conjunto.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1138
translate spanish a1s4_a4bc53af:

    # a "\"They are an arrogant people, as I've said.\""
    a "\"Son un pueblo arrogante, como he dicho.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1139
translate spanish a1s4_cff67bed:

    # m "\"And maybe his intentions aren't all that great if that's how he treats his prospective allies.\""
    m "\"Y quizá sus intenciones no sean tan buenas si así trata a sus posibles aliados.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1141
translate spanish a1s4_e72b5e35:

    # a "\"Agreed.\""
    a "\"De acuerdo.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1143
translate spanish a1s4_c23b90ec:

    # m "\"But I dunno, I'm not a politician.\""
    m "\"Pero no sé; no soy político.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1145
translate spanish a1s4_31977895:

    # a "\"But you are smart!\""
    a "\"¡Pero eres inteligente!\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1146
translate spanish a1s4_1dfc7b4e:

    # m "\"Thanks.\""
    m "\"Gracias.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1148
translate spanish a1s4_e1214122:

    # a "\"Anyway, I'm off to my shower.\""
    a "\"En fin, voy a ducharme.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1149
translate spanish a1s4_1708ddfd:

    # "The wolf stands up, and I do the same."
    "El lobo se levanta y hago lo mismo."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1150
translate spanish a1s4_fe78655b:

    # m "\"Do you need help?\""
    m "\"¿Necesitas ayuda?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1152
translate spanish a1s4_c791bb9d:

    # a "\"Oh...really?\""
    a "\"Ah... ¿de verdad?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1153
translate spanish a1s4_c806ebc0_5:

    # m "\"Yeah.\""
    m "\"Sí.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1154
translate spanish a1s4_697e098d:

    # "I want to show him that things haven't changed, that I'm not scared of him now that I know his secret."
    "Quiero demostrarle que nada ha cambiado y que no le tengo miedo ahora que conozco su secreto."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1155
translate spanish a1s4_c26c3c71:

    # "He looked so devastated when he told me."
    "Parecía tan devastado cuando me lo contó."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1156
translate spanish a1s4_23a0b7a8:

    # "And even if Amicus was the one to get me into this mess, I know now that he's a good person and doesn't deserve to feel like that."
    "Y, aunque Amicus fue quien me metió en este lío, ahora sé que es buena persona y no merece sentirse así."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1157
translate spanish a1s4_48c61ee2:

    # m "\"I mean, I've seen your junk already, so no surprises there, right?\""
    m "\"Es decir, ya he visto lo que tienes ahí abajo, así que no habrá sorpresas, ¿no?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1159
translate spanish a1s4_4f71987f:

    # a "\"Heh, I suppose not...if you're sure.\""
    a "\"Je, supongo que no... si estás seguro.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1160
translate spanish a1s4_3d9e81d6:

    # m "\"I'm sure.\""
    m "\"Estoy seguro.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1162
translate spanish a1s4_8db7c553:

    # "To decide things for the wolf, I walk into the shower."
    "Para tomar la decisión por el lobo, entro en la ducha."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1163
translate spanish a1s4_1f023d98:

    # "Amicus isn't far behind."
    "Amicus me sigue de cerca."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1167
translate spanish a1s4_fec97169:

    # "To be continued..."
    "Continuará..."

translate spanish strings:

    # a1s4.rpy:1126
    old "Talk to him more."
    new "Habla más con él."

    # a1s4.rpy:1126
    old "Reject him."
    new "Recházalo."

